'''Foia Gran Airport''' ({{lang|ca|Aeroport de Foia Gran}}; [[IATA airport code|IATA]]: FOI, [[ICAO airport code|ICAO]]: FOIB) is a domestic airport serving [[Foia Gran]], a community in the [[La Foia]] comarca of the interior of [[Nurra Province]], [[Balboa]]. The airport serves the northern Nurra interior highlands. It is served by [[Aeroístmus]], which operates essential services from [[Cecilio Ríos International Airport|Sant Bart]].

